// Day 5 - Task 5: Application Insights latency query for QuotesApi
//
// STATUS: NOT EXECUTED. There is no Azure subscription available in this
// environment (same constraint recorded for Task 3 in
// azure-container-apps.sh). No Application Insights resource has been
// provisioned and no telemetry has ever been ingested, so this query has
// never run against real data. Do not treat any numbers as real - none
// exist. No screenshots or KQL output accompany this file.
//
// PREREQUISITES before this can run for real:
//   1. An Azure subscription.
//   2. An Application Insights resource (Microsoft.Insights/components).
//      NOT currently present in infra/resources.bicep - the existing
//      Log Analytics workspace there (`logAnalytics`) is wired only to the
//      Container Apps managed environment for platform/console logs; it is
//      not an Application Insights component and does not receive
//      `requests`/`dependencies`/`exceptions` telemetry.
//   3. QuotesApi's telemetry code already supports this without any code
//      change: Extensions/TelemetryExtensions.cs calls UseAzureMonitor()
//      whenever APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_CONNECTION_STRING (or config key
//      ApplicationInsights:ConnectionString) is set. Only an Application
//      Insights resource + connection string (wired as a Container App
//      secret/env var, the same way Jwt__Key is handled today) are needed.
//   4. Real traffic hitting the deployed app within the queried window.
//
// HOW TO RUN ONCE A SUBSCRIPTION EXISTS:
//   Azure Portal -> Application Insights resource -> Logs, or:
//     az monitor app-insights query \
//       --app <app-insights-app-id> \
//       --analytics-query "requests | where timestamp > ago(30m) | summarize count(), p50=percentile(duration, 50), p99=percentile(duration, 99) by name | order by p99 desc"
//
// QUERY (top endpoints by p99 latency over the last 30 minutes):
requests
| where timestamp > ago(30m)
| summarize count(), p50=percentile(duration, 50), p99=percentile(duration, 99) by name
| order by p99 desc
